            <ArticleTitle>Documenting safe treatment of the medical-risk patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>383-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An easily mastered safe treatment documentation system is presented. The routine consists of two parts, a comprehensive yet manageable medical history and a treatment modification record. Millions of medically compromised patients may now receive comprehensive care in safety.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
